<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Rapih — Tagihan beres, uang cepat masuk</title>
<meta name="description" content="Rapih membantu freelancer dan UMKM membuat invoice, mengirim pengingat, dan melacak pembayaran dalam satu tempat.">
<link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,<svg xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22 viewBox=%220 0 100 100%22><text y=%22.9em%22 font-size=%2290%22>🧾</text></svg>">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:wght@600;800&family=Figtree:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --bg:#F3F6F9; --ink:#12263A; --muted:#51647A; --line:#D3DDE8;
  --accent:#2447F5; --accent-ink:#fff; --ok:#17794D; --ok-bg:#DDF3E8; --warn:#9A5B00; --warn-bg:#FCEBCB;
  --display:"Bricolage Grotesque","Trebuchet MS",sans-serif;
  --body:"Figtree",system-ui,-apple-system,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{background:var(--bg);color:var(--ink);font:400 1.0625rem/1.6 var(--body)}
a{color:inherit}
:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--accent);outline-offset:3px;border-radius:4px}
.wrap{max-width:1080px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 24px}

header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:20px 0}
.logo{font:800 1.5rem var(--display);text-decoration:none;letter-spacing:-.02em}
nav{display:flex;gap:24px;align-items:center;font-weight:500}
nav a{text-decoration:none;color:var(--muted)}
nav a:hover{color:var(--ink)}

.btn{display:inline-block;padding:12px 22px;border-radius:10px;background:var(--accent);color:var(--accent-ink);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid var(--accent);transition:transform .15s}
.btn:hover{transform:translateY(-2px)}
.btn.ghost{background:transparent;color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--ink)}

.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr .9fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;padding:56px 0 88px}
h1{font:800 clamp(2.3rem,5.5vw,3.9rem)/1.05 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.03em;max-width:14ch}
.lead{margin:20px 0 28px;color:var(--muted);max-width:46ch;font-size:1.15rem}
.cta{display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.note{margin-top:14px;font-size:.9rem;color:var(--muted)}

/* Demo invoice: elemen utama halaman */
.invoice{background:#fff;border:2px solid var(--ink);border-radius:14px;padding:24px;box-shadow:8px 8px 0 var(--ink);transform:rotate(1.5deg)}
.invoice h2{font:600 1.1rem var(--display);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center}
.invoice dl{margin:18px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.invoice .row{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);font-size:.97rem}
.invoice dt{color:var(--muted)}
.invoice dd{font-weight:600}
.total{font:800 1.6rem var(--display)}
.status{font-size:.82rem;font-weight:600;padding:4px 10px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--warn-bg);color:var(--warn)}
.status.paid{background:var(--ok-bg);color:var(--ok)}
.pay{width:100%;margin-top:14px;font:600 1rem var(--body);padding:12px;border-radius:10px;border:2px solid var(--ink);background:var(--bg);cursor:pointer}
.pay:hover{background:#E6ECF3}
.hint{text-align:center;font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);margin-top:14px;transform:rotate(1.5deg)}

section{padding:72px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
h2.title{font:800 clamp(1.7rem,3.5vw,2.4rem)/1.15 var(--display);letter-spacing:-.02em;max-width:20ch;margin-bottom:36px}
.features{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:40px}
.features h3{font:600 1.2rem var(--display);margin-bottom:8px}
.features p{color:var(--muted)}

.plans{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:24px;max-width:760px}
.plan{padding:28px;border:2px solid var(--line);border-radius:14px;background:#fff}
.plan.main{border-color:var(--ink)}
.plan h3{font:600 1.2rem var(--display)}
.price{font:800 2.2rem var(--display);margin:8px 0 16px}
.price small{font:400 1rem var(--body);color:var(--muted)}
.plan ul{list-style:none;padding:0;margin-bottom:22px;display:grid;gap:8px}
.plan li::before{content:"✓ ";color:var(--ok);font-weight:700}

.final{text-align:center}
.final h2.title{margin-inline:auto}
footer{padding:32px 0;border-top:1px solid var(--line);color:var(--muted);font-size:.92rem;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px}

@media (max-width:820px){
  .hero{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:40px;padding-bottom:56px}
  .features,.plans{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  nav a:not(.btn){display:none}
}
@media (prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){*{transition:none!important;scroll-behavior:auto!important}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <header>
    <a class="logo" href="#">Rapih</a>
    <nav>
      <a href="#fitur">Fitur</a>
      <a href="#harga">Harga</a>
      <a class="btn" href="#daftar">Coba gratis</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="hero">
      <div>
        <h1>Tagihan beres, uang cepat masuk.</h1>
        <p class="lead">Buat invoice dalam 1 menit, kirim lewat WhatsApp atau email, lalu biarkan Rapih mengingatkan klien yang belum bayar.</p>
        <div class="cta">
          <a class="btn" href="#daftar">Mulai gratis</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="#fitur">Lihat cara kerjanya</a>
        </div>
        <p class="note">Tanpa kartu kredit. Gratis untuk 5 invoice pertama setiap bulan.</p>
      </div>

      <div>
        <article class="invoice" aria-label="Contoh invoice">
          <h2>Invoice #0042 <span class="status" id="status" aria-live="polite">Belum dibayar</span></h2>
          <dl>
            <div class="row"><dt>Klien</dt><dd>Toko Kopi Senja</dd></div>
            <div class="row"><dt>Layanan</dt><dd>Desain menu &amp; logo</dd></div>
            <div class="row"><dt>Jatuh tempo</dt><dd>30 Nov 2026</dd></div>
            <div class="row"><dt>Total</dt><dd class="total">Rp2.500.000</dd></div>
          </dl>
          <button class="pay" id="pay" type="button">Tandai sudah dibayar</button>
        </article>
        <p class="hint">Coba klik tombolnya.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <section id="fitur">
      <h2 class="title">Semua urusan tagihan, di satu tempat.</h2>
      <div class="features">
        <div>
          <h3>Invoice siap kirim</h3>
          <p>Pilih template, isi nama klien dan nominal, selesai. Nomor invoice dibuat otomatis.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Pengingat otomatis</h3>
          <p>Rapih mengirim pengingat sopan sebelum dan sesudah jatuh tempo, jadi Anda tidak perlu menagih sendiri.</p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <h3>Laporan pemasukan</h3>
          <p>Lihat siapa yang sudah bayar, siapa yang belum, dan berapa total pemasukan bulan ini.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="harga">
      <h2 class="title">Harga yang jelas, tanpa biaya tersembunyi.</h2>
      <div class="plans">
        <div class="plan">
          <h3>Gratis</h3>
          <p class="price">Rp0 <small>/bulan</small></p>
          <ul><li>5 invoice per bulan</li><li>Kirim lewat email</li><li>Laporan dasar</li></ul>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="#daftar">Mulai gratis</a>
        </div>
        <div class="plan main">
          <h3>Pro</h3>
          <p class="price">Rp49.000 <small>/bulan</small></p>
          <ul><li>Invoice tanpa batas</li><li>Kirim lewat WhatsApp</li><li>Pengingat otomatis</li></ul>
          <a class="btn" href="#daftar">Coba Pro 14 hari</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section id="daftar" class="final">
      <h2 class="title">Siap menagih tanpa repot?</h2>
      <a class="btn" href="mailto:halo@contoh.com?subject=Daftar%20Rapih">Daftar sekarang</a>
    </section>
  </main>

  <footer>
    <span>© 2026 Rapih. Semua hak dilindungi.</span>
    <span><a href="mailto:halo@contoh.com">halo@contoh.com</a></span>
  </footer>
</div>

<script>
  const btn = document.getElementById('pay');
  const status = document.getElementById('status');
  let paid = false;
  btn.addEventListener('click', () => {
    paid = !paid;
    status.textContent = paid ? 'Lunas' : 'Belum dibayar';
    status.classList.toggle('paid', paid);
    btn.textContent = paid ? 'Batalkan' : 'Tandai sudah dibayar';
  });
</script>
</body>
</html>
